WEBVTT

00:23:28.996 --> 00:23:31.954
brilliant work, and we will feel
closer as a consequence.

00:23:31.954 --> 00:23:36.079
And that has nothing to do with us
being both black or both men

00:23:36.079 --> 00:23:40.954
or whatever it is. It's just that like
we saw this thing about these people

00:23:40.954 --> 00:23:44.579
and we bonded over it. I don't know. I'm
really appreciative that that exists.

00:23:44.788 --> 00:23:46.288
Now, that's the positive side.

00:23:46.496 --> 00:23:47.954
There is also a negative side,

00:23:47.954 --> 00:23:51.246
which is and I think that the sort of
moment of racial reckoning that we're

00:23:51.246 --> 00:23:55.746
seeing around the globe is in large part
connected to the movie industry,

00:23:56.079 --> 00:24:00.079
because when we go into a room and we sit
with a lot of people we don't know